(cited `1_2:line`): `(MBM)` `1_2:686`, `(stoch_domination)` `1_2:227–231`.

* Section 8 of the compiled T2002 probe (`RBM3D/Probe/T2002Vocab.lean` at `5d2a4a8` on branch
